  "body": "I (@tleydxdy:mt.tlebear.win) can create room with or invite people from other HSs, but they cannot invite or start a room with me. Other functions works fine (e2e, video/audio chat, file sharing etc). \r\nThis might be related to #3650, as I found this out during the investigation for that bug.\r\n\r\n\r\n    Version: currently 0.33.7, happened since 0.33.1, #3650 a while back in 0.31 iirc\r\n    Install method: apt\r\n    Platform: debian 9 VM\r\n",
